title: Fundraising
new-page: true
view-if: fundraising_timer <= 0 and (not historical_mode)
on-arrival: fundraising_timer = 6; week_actions += 1
frequency: 300
is-card: true
card-image: img/kmtfund.jpg
tags: party_affairs

= Fundraising

For better or for worse, the party cannot exist without money.

- @maintain: Maintain fundraising efforts.
- @reduce: Reduce fundraising efforts.
- @increase: Increase fundraising efforts.

@maintain
subtitle: [+ income +] funds gained.
on-arrival: funds += income;

We maintain our current income.

@reduce
subtitle: [+ income - 1 +] funds gained.
choose-if: income > 1
on-arrival: income -= 1; funds += income; left_dissent -= 8; center_left_dissent -= 8; center_dissent -= 8; right_dissent -= 8; whmapoa_dissent -= 8

Our current members appreciate this, but no one decides to join a party because of the low income.

@increase
subtitle: [+ income + 1 +] funds gained.
on-arrival: income += 1; funds += income; left_dissent += 8; center_left_dissent += 8; center_dissent += 8; right_dissent += 8; whmapoa_dissent += 8
view-if: income <= 4

Our members grumble at this, and some of the less committed members leave. But now, we have access to additional funds. 

